Emit R3000A native operations offline from executable IRX sections.
Preserve the existing console state and scheduler; validate non-relocated opcode bits.
Fix branch delay exceptions, zero-link JALR and paired unaligned load forwarding.
Instruction semantics derive from the pinned ps2xIOP core (GPL-3.0).

